    {
      "id": "956ae03133c712e2b4ab621d40d1dcdebb42625e",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2554441297,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Coverity turned up the following:\n\n```\nCID 1649289: (#1 of 1): unsafe_xml_parse_config (UNSAFE_XML_PARSE_CONFIG)\nunsafe_xml_parse_config: XML parse option should not have flag XML_PARSE_NOENT set, which is vulnerable to XML external entity attack.\n2780    doc = xmlReadFile(filename, NULL, XML_PARSE_NOENT);\n```\n\nIt doesn't look like _wimaxasncp/dictionary.xml_ has any entities; should we omit the confusingly-named `XML_PARSE_NOENT` in this case? Otherwise it looks like we should pass `XML_PARSE_NO_XXE` as well.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1788825804",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:31:41.642Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-06-10T18:31:41.642Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 389175113,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
